{"title":"Emberweave Legs","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Tailoring Lv 67)</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Tailoring at level 67 <span class=\"muted\">(23379 XP)</span> from 4× <a href=\"#/item/emberweave-knick\">Emberweave Knick</a>, 10× <a href=\"#/item/frostwool\">Frostwool</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/tailoring\">Tailoring</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/emberweave-knick\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/f9e60aa82b99ffcb1da4.svg\" alt=\"\">Emberweave Knick</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/frostwool\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/gen/e624028c088a03d47c1f.svg\" alt=\"\">Frostwool</a></p>\n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/gen/3c913cd3060207e9119a.svg\" alt=\"Emberweave Legs\"></div><h3>Emberweave Legs</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Tailoring 67</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </table></aside></article>"}